rsations  </span><span begin="00:27.264" end="00:27.794">led </span><span begin="00:27.794" end="00:28.524">to </span><span begin="00:28.524" end="00:30.254">complications</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.254" end="00:33.774"><span begin="00:30.254" end="00:30.834">Now </span><span begin="00:30.834" end="00:31.574">my </span><span begin="00:31.574" end="00:31.994">heart </span><span begin="00:31.994" end="00:32.254">is </span><span begin="00:32.254" end="00:32.624">in </span><span begin="00:32.624" end="00:32.914">my </span><span begin="00:32.914" end="00:33.774">hands</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.004" end="00:39.264"><span begin="00:36.004" end="00:36.204">Cause </span><span begin="00:36.204" end="00:36.434">you </span><span begin="00:36.434" end="00:36.824">walked </span><span begin="00:36.824" end="00:37.324">out </span><span begin="00:37.324" end="00:37.584">and </span><span begin="00:37.584" end="00:37.874">left </span><span begin="00:37.874" end="00:38.224">me </span><span begin="00:38.224" end="00:39.264">stranded</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.264" end="00:42.024"><span begin="00:39.264" end="00:39.804">Nothing </span><span begin="00:39.804" end="00:40.164">left </span><span begin="00:40.164" end="00:40.534">but </span><span begin="00:40.534" end="00:41.264">picture </span><span begin="00:41.264" end="00:42.024">frames</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.024" end="00:45.174"><span begin="00:42.024" end="00:42.224">And </span><span begin="00:42.224" end="00:42.564">I </span><span begin="00:42.564" end="00:42.814">just </span><span begin="00:42.814" end="00:43.174">keep </span><span begin="00:43.174" end="00:43.514">on </span><span begin="00:43.514" end="00:44.234">asking </span><span begin="00:44.234" end="00:45.174">myself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.174" end="00:50.611"><span begin="00:45.174" end="00:45.563">How'd </span><span begin="00:45.563" end="00:45.843">we </span><span begin="00:45.843" end="00:46.173">drift </span><span begin="00:46.173" end="00:46.513">so </span><span begin="00:46.513" end="00:46.903">far </span><span begin="00:46.903" end="00:47.922">away </span><span begin="00:47.922" end="00:48.142">from </span><span begin="00:48.142" end="00:48.412">where </span><span begin="00:48.412" end="00:48.782">we </span><span begin="00:48.782" end="00:49.112">left </span><span begin="00:49.112" end="00:49.531">off </span><span begin="00:49.531" end="00:50.611">yesterday </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.761" end="00:54.370"><span begin="00:50.761" end="00:51.101">I'm </span><span begin="00:51.101" end="00:51.801">lonely </span><span begin="00:51.801" end="00:52.171">like </span><span begin="00:52.171" end="00:52.491">a </span><span begin="00:52.491" end="00:54.370">castaway</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.240" end="01:02.810"><span begin="00:57.240" end="00:57.870">Heartbreak </span><span begin="00:57.870" end="00:58.140">that </span><span begin="00:58.140" end="00:58.500">I </span><span begin="00:58.500" end="00:58.860">can't </span><span begin="00:58.860" end="00:59.930">escape  </span><span begin="00:59.930" end="01:00.150">a </span><span begin="01:00.150" end="01:00.770">sinking </span><span begin="01:00.770" end="01:01.130">ship </span><span begin="01:01.130" end="01:01.470">I'll </span><span begin="01:01.470" end="01:02.100">never </span><span begin="01:02.100" end="01:02.810">save</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.890" end="01:06.379"><span begin="01:02.890" end="01:03.100">I'm </span><span begin="01:03.100" end="01:03.830">lonely </span><span begin="01:03.830" end="01:04.160">like </span><span begin="01:04.160" end="01:04.500">a </span><span begin="01:04.500" end="01:06.379">castaway</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.249" end="01:14.997"><span begin="01:09.249" end="01:09.858">All </span><span begin="01:09.858" end="01:10.488">your </span><span begin="01:10.488" end="01:11.188">screaming </span><span begin="01:11.188" end="01:1